<view class="page checkout"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在确认课程信息…</view><view wx:elif="{{!course}}" class="card error-card">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><block wx:elif="{{paid}}"><view class="success-card card"><view class="success-check">✓</view><view class="success-title">课程已开通</view><view class="muted small">新的进步，现在开始</view><view class="success-course">{{course.title}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="learn">进入课程，开始学习 →</button><view wx:if="{{config.demoMode}}" class="small muted success-demo">本次为演示开通，未发生真实扣款</view></view></block><block wx:else><view class="eyebrow">ONE STEP CLOSER</view><view class="page-title">确认课程订单</view><view class="subtitle">把值得的时间，留给值得的成长</view><view class="order-course card"><view class="order-subject" style="background:{{course.color}}">{{course.subject}}</view><view><view class="order-course-title">{{course.title}}</view><view class="small muted">{{course.teacher}} · {{course.lessonCount}} 节课时</view><text class="tag">{{course.grade}}</text><text class="tag">{{course.type}}</text></view></view><view class="card order-summary"><view class="between"><text>课程价格</text><text>¥{{course.priceText}}</text></view><view class="between"><text>课程资料</text><text class="muted">包含配套讲义</text></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="between total"><text>实付款</text><view class="money"><text class="money-unit">¥</text>{{course.priceText}}</view></view></view><view class="card payment-method"><view class="between"><text>支付方式</text><view class="payment-label"><text class="payment-indicator">✓</text>{{config.demoMode ? '模拟支付（演示）' : course.price > 0 ? '微信支付' : '免费课程'}}</view></view><view class="payment-copy">{{config.demoMode ? '此环境仅用于体验购买流程，点击模拟支付不会真实扣款。' : course.price > 0 ? '使用微信安全支付。服务端确认支付成功后，即可学习全部课时并下载资料。' : '确认后将免费加入课程，可在我的课程随时学习。'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice">{{error}}</view><view class="order-note"><view><text>✓</text> 课程开通后，可在「我的课程」查看</view><view><text>✓</text> 如支付后未开通，可从「我的订单」刷新结果</view></view><button wx:if="{{pending}}" class="secondary refresh-order" bindtap="refresh" loading="{{busy}}">刷新支付结果</button><view wx:if="{{needsWechat}}" class="notice">手机号登录后，先关联同一手机号的微信身份即可支付。</view><view class="fixed-footer"><button wx:if="{{needsWechat}}" open-type="getPhoneNumber" bindgetphonenumber="bindWechat" class="primary" loading="{{binding}}" disabled="{{binding}}">关联微信身份后支付</button><button wx:else class="primary" bindtap="pay" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">{{busy ? '正在处理，请稍候' : config.demoMode ? '模拟支付 ¥' + course.priceText + '（演示）' : course.price > 0 ? '微信支付 ¥' + course.priceText : '确认免费加入'}}</button><view class="checkout-footer-link" bindtap="orders">查看我的订单 ›</view></view></block></view>
